1. Purpose

This "Recovery_Util" is executed only for the case of recovery.
Now only one utility is implemented, which is "Recovery_Flag".
In order to restart the simulation correctly from checkpoint files, 
this flag is used by Whisky and BSSN_MoL.

The detail scheduling is as follows:

************************************************************
***   Cactus Schelling
************************************************************

   if (recover initial data)

      [CCTK_BASEGRID]

      etc..

      [CCTK_RECOVER_VARIABLES]

        IOUtil::IOUtil_RecoverGH: [level] Checkpoint recovery routine
        Recovery_Util::Recovery_Set: We set Recovery_Flag=1(i.e., TRUE).

      [CCTK_POST_RECOVER_VARIABLES]

        etc...
      
        Recovery_Util::Recovery_Reset: We reset Recovery_Flag=0(i.e., FALSE).

   endif

************************************************************
************************************************************
